    <h2>Business Recommendation</h2>
    <p>Based on the A/B test results, Top Tier Equipment should <strong>deploy Version B — customer reviews below the Add to Cart button — as the new standard product page layout.</strong></p>
    <ul class="rl">
      <li>The 31% relative lift in purchase-through rate (3.87% → 5.07%) is statistically significant at the 95% confidence level (p = 0.047), meaning the result is unlikely to be due to chance.</li>
      <li>The confidence interval [+0.01%, +2.39%] is entirely positive — confirming that Version B is very likely better, not a fluke in either direction.</li>
      <li>The layout change is costless to implement — it requires only reordering existing HTML/CSS elements — making the risk/reward ratio extremely favorable.</li>
      <li>After deployment, Top Tier should monitor live conversion rates for 30–60 days to confirm the simulated result holds under real-world conditions, including device type, season, and traffic source variation.</li>
